        "description": "<p><strong>Dinosaur Man</strong> is a premium BigCommerce theme designed for men's fashion stores, offering a sleek, responsive design with 3 unique variations. The <strong>Man</strong> variation is ideal for businesses selling men's clothing, shoes, and accessories, providing a seamless, immersive shopping experience.</p><p>With powerful customization options, you can easily personalize typography, color schemes, product displays, and page layouts. Support for <strong>Google</strong> and <strong>third-party fonts</strong> ensures your store maintains a distinct and professional look.</p><p>Key features include a custom header background image for impactful branding and two homepage layout options\u2014full width or sidebar. The <strong>shopping-by-product-tags widget</strong> lets customers shop directly from images with a drag-and-drop interface, no coding required, integrated smoothly via BC Page Builder.</p><p>Additional highlights include a <strong>Coupons widget</strong> that displays coupons on the PDP and Cart Page, allowing customers to apply them with one click for a faster checkout experience. The <strong>Bulk Pricing Tiers Slider</strong> on PDP automatically updates quantities as users interact with the slider, while the <strong>Frequently Bought Together</strong> feature helps boost sales by suggesting related products. The <strong>Save for Later</strong> option in the cart lets customers move items to a wishlist for future purchases, increasing customer retention.</p><p>Other features include a dynamic <strong>mega menu builder</strong>, faceted product filters (Pro/Enterprise), <strong>infinite scrolling</strong>, <strong>product comparison</strong>, <strong>video galleries</strong>, <strong>shipping countdown timer</strong>, <strong>flash sale alerts</strong>, and a <strong>fully functional cart popup</strong>.</p><p>With detailed user guides and video tutorials, setting up your Dinosaur Man store is easy, no matter your tech